{"id":"cc24f2c1587a5632","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-p-complete.md","title":"df-p-complete (P-Complete under Logspace Many-One Reductions)","display":"df-p-complete (P-Complete under Logspace Many-One Reductions)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-p-complete","display":"df-p-complete (P-Complete under Logspace Many-One Reductions)","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]","[[28-df-nc]]"],"aliases":["28-df-p-complete","P-Complete","P-Complete under Logspace Reductions"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-p-complete"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-complete (P-Complete under Logspace Many-One Reductions)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a91903f455f49892\" href=\"?note=a91903f455f49892\" title=\"28-df-logspace-reduction\">28-df-logspace-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"348985e8f68576a3\" href=\"?note=348985e8f68576a3\" title=\"28-df-nc\">28-df-nc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-p-complete</span><span>P-Complete</span><span>P-Complete under Logspace Reductions</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a91903f455f49892\" href=\"?note=a91903f455f49892\" title=\"28-df-logspace-reduction\">28-df-logspace-reduction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FNC}\">\\(\\mathbf{FNC}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"348985e8f68576a3\" href=\"?note=348985e8f68576a3\" title=\"28-df-nc\">28-df-nc</a> 中另行指定的多输出电路函数类；旧有 NC 归约变体以下标显式保留，均不作为原书 P 完全性的定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{PComplete}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathbf P\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathbf P\\;A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\},\\\\\nA\\le_m^{\\mathbf{NC}}B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FNC}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PComplete}_{\\mathbf{NC}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathbf P\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathbf P\\;A\\le_m^{\\mathbf{NC}}B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{PComplete}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathbf P\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathbf P\\;A\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B\\},\\\\\nA\\le_m^{\\mathbf{NC}}B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FNC}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B),\\\\\n\\mathbf{PComplete}_{\\mathbf{NC}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathbf P\\mid\\forall A\\in\\mathbf P\\;A\\le_m^{\\mathbf{NC}}B\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定义6.28使用确定型对数空间多一归约。尤其不能以非一致 NC 归约悄悄替换，因为其均匀性和计算能力不同。保留旧变体符号是为了兼容历史引用，但本书对应对象为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PComplete}\">\\(\\mathbf{PComplete}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义6.28；印刷119页；PDF145页。已修正原书归约约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"